---
description: >-
  Nested flow containers — a "Content Team" container holding two nested
  sub-containers ("Researcher", "Writer"), each with one task node, connected by
  an edge that crosses the inner container boundary.
---
agentflow-beta TB
  flow team["Content Team"]
    flow researcher["Researcher"]
      gather["Gather sources"]@{ shape: task }
    end

    flow writer["Writer"]
      compose["Compose draft"]@{ shape: task }
    end

    researcher --> writer
  end
